{"availability":"available","full":"mlm-games/renamite","name":"renamite","description":"A WIP motion / vector animation editor. Good for viewing and slight movement, editing and most tools aren't complete only on the UI side","category":"Design","language":"Rust","stars":3,"forks":0,"created":"2026-08-09T04:13:52Z","updated":"2026-10-17T07:04:27Z","license":"MPL-2.0","branch":"main","homepage":"https://mlm-games.github.io/renamite/","topics":["animations","timeline-editor","vector-graphics"],"demo":"https://mlm-games.github.io/renamite/","color":"#323057","ink":"#d6caff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-17T07:10:56.503Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-17T07:10:56.503Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-17T07:10:56.503Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-11T07:27:03.076Z","stars":1,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-17T07:10:56.503Z","stars":3,"forks":0}],"technologies":["Rust"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["A motion / vector animation editor built on repose, with tessellation via lyon, and kurbo.","The editor supports creating vector primitives, importing image/font assets, editing layer and property values (with undo), renaming and reordering layers, scrubbing and basic animation, and exporting frames as PNG/SVG and animation as Lottie. The timeline shows a row per animated property (plus selection fallback), with keyframe add/drag, easing cycle, box-select, and curve clamping; clip/machine lanes are previewed via the player. There are other rough edges that (might) have to be handled in repose for completion. kurbo is the path math type. The document/animation models are independent…"],"features":[],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/mlm-games/renamite/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"dcfe1f2261fd669c4f4146fec71c06fc5ec72c52a5b445b064580ac29a5e6d70","extractedAt":"2026-10-11T07:27:03.158Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-11T07:27:03.158Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"A motion / vector animation editor built on repose, with tessellation via lyon, and kurb